clauses.text:
(1) Pollution from all existing Federal facilities and buildings shall 
be controlled in accordance with plans to be submitted to the Director 
of the Bureau of the Budget pursuant to Section 3 of this Order ;

(2) New Federal facilities and buildings shall be constructed so as 
to meet" the pollution control standards prescribed by Section 4 of 
this Order ;

(4) Review and surveillance of all such activities shall be main­
tained to assure that pollution control standards are met on a 
continuing basis ;

